          "path": "_m/q/w/8/6/ranu-pani-wp/ranupane.jpg",
          "filename": "RanuPane.jpg",
          "caption": "Indonesia has millions of beauties in its diversity. One of them is Ranu Pane which is one of the lakes that is worth and must be visited in climbing to the highest mountain on the island of Java, Mahameru. The diversity of Indonesia is in fact not only about ethnic groups, biota in the lake ecosystem is also very diverse. Rows of pine trees always accompany all the way from Senduro Village, Lumajang Regency. Treat the clear lake and the cold air can not be separated from Ranu Pane. Green mixed with blue is often charming isn't it?",
